[[Stone]]s are a [[Weapon]] available in the shop for all characters, at common rarity. It can normally only be thrown once, unlike most other [[Weapon]]s. Stones can be used with [[Bag of Stones]] to be able to throw them multiple times per battle, like a normal weapon, making for a decent zero stamina method for destroying {{icon/block}} and dealing some general low-grade damage. When combined with the [[Stoned]] [[Skill]], a fraction of the [[Stone]]s damage also grants the user {{icon/block}}. 

Since the [[Stone]] only costs a single {{icon/gold}}, and no item can sell for less than 1{{icon/gold}}, there is no drawback to purchasing one, as it can be resold whenever needed for a full refund.

The [[Stone Golem]] requires four [[Stone]]s to be crafted, which can be difficult to naturally find in the shop. Consider using a [[Shovel]], [[Offering Bowl]], or [[Stone Badge]] to ease the process.

